{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/1485789-hunter-2nd-edition-errata","id":1485789,"title":"Hunter - 2nd Edition Errata","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-07-04T12:06:47-07:00","id":1485789,"title":"Hunter - 2nd Edition Errata","content":"Hello - does anyone know where we should we be reporting errata / inconsistencies for the 2nd edition to?<br /> <br /> More specifically it seems odd that in one such example, the merit Holistic Awareness has no prerequisites in the base CoD core book but requires Survival 3 &amp; Medicine 1 as prerequisites in H:tV 2nd edition. Seems to be many more such cases of inconsistencies between longstanding merits and what's presented in the book on just an initial passthrough.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27475-burzghash","name":"Burzghash","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T12:40:47-07:00","id":1485791,"title":"","content":"The window for submitting errata was months ago. There was a Google form. It's closed now. If your PDF copy has &quot;Final Download&quot; in the filename it's not getting updated again barring some unusual circumstance.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T14:01:13-07:00","id":1485798,"title":"","content":"Tolerance for Biology in CoD:<br /> Prerequisites: Resolve 3<br /> <br /> Tolerance for Biology in HtV:<br /> Prerequisites: Resolve 3 or Medicine 2<br /> <br /> Seems sloppy to me \ud83e\udd37","signature":"","edited":{"userid":27475,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27475-burzghash","user":"Burzghash","date":". 07-04-2022, 05:06 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27475-burzghash","name":"Burzghash","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-04T15:06:29-07:00","id":1485801,"title":"","content":"Mummy runs cults on different Attributes than krewes and conspiracies, Geist has a version of the Retainer Merit that gives them Merits of their own, Beast has a version of Iron Skin that doesn't have a Brawl prerequisite, and Werewolf has a Tracking system that has nothing to do with the Chase and Investigation rules that were rolled out years after its release.<br /> <br /> The Revised Storytelling System core rulebook came out in 2017 and was largely reprinting material from the God-Machine Chronicle Rules Update seen in Demon: the Descent in 2013. Hunter 2e came out within the last year and is part of an edition where you are no longer expected to cross-reference the core rulebook with the book for the specific game you're playing. The Ambidextrous Merit is mentioned offhand in multiple books where the Ambidextrous Merit is not printed, and the Arm Wrack Tilt has changed its description over time such that this no longer matters. The books have not been made and published all at the same time and a lot of complicating factors have arisen during the last ten years of Onyx Path's time as a company.<br /> <br /> Ideally if a ChroD 3e happens it will not be subject to the same unique shenanigans that afflicted 2e at the beginning and the game can have all its ducks in a row from the beginning going forward, but &quot;if you're playing Hunter some Merits list minor prerequisites that a basic mortals game didn't \u2014 including a Merit that <i>hasn't shown up in any other line's list of Merits since Demon</i>&quot; is an incredibly minor inconsistency.<br /> <br /> Use the listed prerequisites if you're playing Hunter. Otherwise, decide for yourself if you want to port over the notion that characters with job-level training in Medicine don't need above-average Resolve to avoid risking throwing up when exposed to blood and guts (Deviant explicitly puts the Resolve prerequisite as a thing the Remade don't have to worry about for Tolerance for Biology) or that a character who needs to make a Survival roll to gather medicinal plants from a place where such plants might be found should probably have some medical and/or survival knowledge to justify knowing that with the investment of a one-dot Merit.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":111,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","user":"Satchel","date":". 07-04-2022, 06:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-07-05T11:05:50-07:00","id":1485849,"title":"","content":"There are definitely a lot of minor inconsistencies between different iterations of the game. I tend to take the view that the latest-in-time should control, and use Deviant as my general go-to reference.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":543,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","user":"Professor Phobos","date":". 07-05-2022, 08:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/543-professor-phobos","name":"Professor Phobos","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}